; Redline: driving metal, 16 bars in E minor at 168 BPM, loops (about 23 s).
; A lead, B rhythm guitar (saw power chords: root + fifth as fast arpeggios,
; chugged short), D drums (double kick). Channel C is left out: Paula
; channel 2 is the engine. Sound effects borrow D, so the drums drop out then.
#title Redline
#tempo 168
#inst lead square vol=40 decay=1
#inst rhy saw vol=46 decay=3
#inst kick kick vol=60
#inst snare snare vol=48
#inst crash crash vol=34

; ---- lead: verse (the riff) twice, the second an octave up; chorus C G D Em
A @lead l4
A o4 e4. g8 b4 a8 g8        | o4 f+4 e8 d8 e2
A o4 e4. g8 b4 > d8 < b8    | o4 a4 g8 f+8 e2
A o5 e4. g8 b4 a8 g8        | o5 f+4 e8 d8 e2
A o5 e4. g8 b4 > d8 < b8    | o5 a4 g8 f+8 e2
A o5 g4 e4 g4 a4            | o5 b4. a8 g4 d4
A o5 a4 f+4 a4 b4           | o5 b2. r4
A o6 c4 < b4 g4 e4          | o5 d4 g4 b4 > d4
A o6 d4 c+8 < a8 f+4 a4     | o5 e2 r4 < b4

; ---- rhythm: the riff (chugs on E, a run up at the end), then gallops
B @rhy l16 q3
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (dg) (dg) (ea) (ea) (f+b) (ea)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (cg) (cg) (cg) (cg) (da) (da) (da) (da)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (dg) (dg) (ea) (ea) (f+b) (ea)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (cg) (cg) (cg) (cg) (da) (da) (da) (da)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (dg) (dg) (ea) (ea) (f+b) (ea)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (cg) (cg) (cg) (cg) (da) (da) (da) (da)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (dg) (dg) (ea) (ea) (f+b) (ea)
B o2 (eb) (eb) (eb) r (eb) (eb) (eb) r (cg) (cg) (cg) (cg) (da) (da) (da) (da)
B o2 [(cg)8 (cg) (cg)]4 | o2 [(dg)8 (dg) (dg)]4 | o2 [(da)8 (da) (da)]4 | o2 [(eb)8 (eb) (eb)]4
B o2 [(cg)8 (cg) (cg)]4 | o2 [(dg)8 (dg) (dg)]4 | o2 [(da)8 (da) (da)]4 | o2 [(eb)8 (eb) (eb)]4

; ---- drums: double kick 16ths, snare on 2 and 4, a crash every 4 bars
D o4 l16
D [@crash c @kick c c c @snare c @kick c c c c c c c @snare c @kick c c c [@kick c c c c @snare c @kick c c c c c c c @snare c @kick c c c]3]4
